#~ ":meth:`~mmap.mmap.size` and :meth:`~mmap.mmap.resize` methods will fail. "
#~ "This mode is useful to limit the number of open file handles. The original "
#~ "file can be renamed (but not deleted) after closing *fileno*."
#~ msgstr ""

